            "text": "{\"model\":\"mimo-v2.5\",\"tools\":[{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"get_app_form\",\"description\":\"读取当前创意应用表单的可配置字段快照。改表前若不确定现有值，先调这个。\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{},\"additionalProperties\":false}}},{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"apply_app_form\",\"description\":\"把用户点名要改的字段写入表单。只传需要改的字段；未传的字段保持原值。封面和预置素材不要写。\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"desc\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"output\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"image\",\"video\"]},\"prompt\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"promptLocked\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"surfaces\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"sortOrder\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"isEnabled\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"lockModel\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"modelLocked\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"aspectRatio\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"aspectRatioLocked\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"resolution\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resolutionLocked\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"duration\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"number\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"durationLocked\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"inputMode\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"bag\",\"slots\"]},\"bagLabel\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bagAccept\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"image\",\"video\"]}},\"bagMin\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"bagMax\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"slots\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"key\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"accept\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"image\",\"video\"]}},\"min\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"max\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"locked\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"additionalProperties\":false}}}],\"id\":\"52583105-9370-4dab-82d7-45914dfdfac2\",\"trigger\":\"submit-message\",\"messageId\":\"2018ab61-68ea-4f0e-a5bd-61552c950552\",\"messages\":[{\"id\":\"turn-instructions\",\"role\":\"system\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"你是一匡AI后台的「创意应用」配置助手。运营用自然语言描述需求，你通过工具读写右侧表单。\\n\\n当前模板只有「通用视觉生成」(visual-generate)。用户在网站上看到的是：标题、简介、可选的模型选择、提示词、上传槽/上传袋，然后一键生成图片或视频。get_app_form 会带 availableModels 与 paramOptions，改模型/比例/清晰度/时长前先看这两份列表。\\n\\n必须用 tool 改表：\\n- get_app_form：读取当前表单快照\\n- apply_app_form：只传需要改的字段；未传的字段保持原值\\n禁止在回复里输出整份 JSON 或要求运营自己粘贴。回复用一两句简体中文说明你改了什么。\\n\\n字段约定（apply_app_form）：\\n- title / desc / prompt / 槽 label / bagLabel：给用户看，必须是繁体中文\\n- output: \\\"image\\\" | \\\"video\\\"\\n- promptLocked: 固定玩法、不让用户改提示词 → true（用户端完全不显示提示词框）\\n- surfaces: 默认含 \\\"design-sidebar\\\"；可选再加 \\\"home-grid\\\"\\n- lockModel: 必填，产品模型 name，只能从 availableModels 里选，且须匹配 output（图片 image，视频 video）。不要编造、不要留空。\\n- modelLocked 按内容类型决定：\\n  * 涉及图内文字渲染（海报文案、Logo、带序号图鉴、图内标签）→ true 并锁定 openai/gpt-image-2，目前只有它对文字渲染把握最好\\n  * 风格写真、人像、商品合成、图生视频等不渲染文字的 → false，允许用户切换同类型模型（lockModel 仍作为默认值，优先选效果最好的档位）\\n- aspectRatio / resolution / duration 必须从 paramOptions 里选（options 来自当前 lockModel 的 schema）。固定则填好值并锁定；想让用户自选则 Locked=false，值作为默认。换模型后这三项会按「比例最接近 / 清晰度最低档 / 时长最短」对齐，apply 时仍只传合法值。\\n  * 比例只用主流档位：竖图 3:4 / 2:3 / 9:16，横图 4:3 / 3:2 / 16:9，方形 1:1；不要用 4:5 等冷门档（多数模型不支持）\\n- inputMode: 用户随便丢参考图、没有明确分工 → bag；有明确角色（商品图 / 人像 / 背景）→ slots，key 用英文、label 用繁体\\n  * 人像参考槽惯例：min 1、max 3（用户常传正面/侧面/背面多角度照），prompt 末尾追加「若传入多张人物参考图，视为同一人物的不同角度，综合所有参考图保持面部与身份一致」\\n- promptLocked: 绝大多数玩法 → true，用户只传素材、勾参数、一键生成；只有明确让用户自由写提示词的开放型玩法才 false\\n- 封面和预置素材由运营在表单里自己选，不要编造、不要用 tool 写\\n- 没提到的字段不要传，保持表单原值\\n- 修改场景：结合当前上下文 / get_app_form，只改被点名的部分\\n\\n当前上下文：\\n{\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"desc\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"output\\\": \\\"image\\\",\\n  \\\"prompt\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"promptLocked\\\": false,\\n  \\\"surfaces\\\": [\\n    \\\"design-sidebar\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"sortOrder\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"isEnabled\\\": true,\\n  \\\"lockModel\\\": \\\"openai/gpt-image-2\\\",\\n  \\\"modelLocked\\\": false,\\n  \\\"aspectRatio\\\": \\\"auto\\\",\\n  \\\"aspectRatioLocked\\\": false,\\n  \\\"resolution\\\": \\\"1K\\\",\\n  \\\"resolutionLocked\\\": false,\\n  \\\"duration\\\": null,\\n  \\\"durationLocked\\\": false,\\n  \\\"inputMode\\\": \\\"bag\\\",\\n  \\\"bagLabel\\\": \\\"參考素材\\\",\\n  \\\"bagAccept\\\": [\\n    \\\"image\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"bagMin\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"bagMax\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"bagPresetCount\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"hasCover\\\": false,\\n  \\\"slots\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"source\\\",\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"參考素材\\\",\\n      \\\"accept\\\": [\\n        \\\"image\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"min\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"max\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"locked\\\": false,\\n      \\\"presetCount\\\": 0\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"availableModels\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"openai/gpt-image-2\\\",\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"GPT Image 2（openai/gpt-image-2）\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"google/nano-banana-2\\\",\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"Nano Banana 2（google/nano-banana-2）\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"bytedance/seedream-5-pro\\\",\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"Seedream 5 Pro（bytedance/seedream-5-pro）\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"bytedance/seedream-5-lite\\\",\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"Seedream 5 Lite（bytedance/seedream-5-lite）\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"paramOptions\\\": {\\n    \\\"aspectRatio\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"auto\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"auto\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"1:1\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"1:1\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"16:9\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"16:9\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"9:16\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"9:16\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"4:3\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"4:3\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"3:4\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"3:4\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"3:2\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"3:2\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"2:3\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"2:3\\\"\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"resolution\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"1K\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"1K\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"2K\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"2K\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"4K\\\",\\n        \\\"value\\\": \\\"4K\\\"\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"duration\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"}]},{\"id\":\"f3294d7b-c666-48b2-849c-e861e5ce46f7\",\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"我想以这个提示词做一个app：Transform the subject from the reference image into a cute, quirky hand-drawn doodle illustration. Use a minimalist children’s storybook / fashion sketch aesthetic with loose, imperfect black ink lines, visible scribbly pencil strokes, subtle cross-hatching, and a charming handmade feel. Keep the character’s recognizable facial features, hairstyle, face shape, clothing, accessories, and overall identity from the reference while simplifying them into a cute illustrated character. Character design: - Oversized head and small simplified body - Simple dot-like eyes and tiny minimal mouth - Soft rounded facial features - Slight rosy pink blush on the cheeks - Messy, expressive hand-drawn hair with many loose sketch lines - Slightly exaggerated, playful proportions - Natural, relaxed pose with a whimsical fashion-illustration feel Art style: - Black-and-white pencil/ink doodle drawing - Rough, imperfect sketch lines rather than clean digital outlines - Dense scribbled hair and clothing details - Light hand-colored accents - Subtle watercolor/crayon-like coloring - Minimal shading - White or off-white clean background - Lots of negative space - Cute, innocent, playful, cozy aesthetic - Looks like an original handmade notebook/fashion doodle illustration Preserve the important details of the reference image while converting everything into this consistent doodle-art style. The final image should feel hand-sketched, slightly imperfect, adorable, expressive, and effortlessly stylish, not like polished vector art or 3D cartoon art.\"}]},{\"id\":\"2018ab61-68ea-4f0e-a5bd-61552c950552\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"step-start\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"让我先读取当前表单确认一下现有配置。\",\"state\":\"done\"},{\"type\":\"tool-get_app_form\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_8e66a804ed754d268173f080\",\"state\":\"output-available\",\"input\":{},\"output\":{\"title\":\"\",\"desc\":\"\",\"output\":\"image\",\"prompt\":\"\",\"promptLocked\":false,\"surfaces\":[\"design-sidebar\"],\"sortOrder\":0,\"isEnabled\":true,\"lockModel\":\"openai/gpt-image-2\",\"modelLocked\":false,\"aspectRatio\":\"auto\",\"aspectRatioLocked\":false,\"resolution\":\"1K\",\"resolutionLocked\":false,\"duration\":null,\"durationLocked\":false,\"inputMode\":\"bag\",\"bagLabel\":\"參考素材\",\"bagAccept\":[\"image\"],\"bagMin\":1,\"bagMax\":1,\"bagPresetCount\":0,\"hasCover\":false,\"slots\":[{\"key\":\"source\",\"label\":\"參考素材\",\"accept\":[\"image\"],\"min\":1,\"max\":1,\"locked\":false,\"presetCount\":0}],\"availableModels\":[{\"name\":\"openai/gpt-image-2\",\"label\":\"GPT Image 2（openai/gpt-image-2）\"},{\"name\":\"google/nano-banana-2\",\"label\":\"Nano Banana 2（google/nano-banana-2）\"},{\"name\":\"bytedance/seedream-5-pro\",\"label\":\"Seedream 5 Pro（bytedance/seedream-5-pro）\"},{\"name\":\"bytedance/seedream-5-lite\",\"label\":\"Seedream 5 Lite（bytedance/seedream-5-lite）\"}],\"paramOptions\":{\"aspectRatio\":[{\"label\":\"auto\",\"value\":\"auto\"},{\"label\":\"1:1\",\"value\":\"1:1\"},{\"label\":\"16:9\",\"value\":\"16:9\"},{\"label\":\"9:16\",\"value\":\"9:16\"},{\"label\":\"4:3\",\"value\":\"4:3\"},{\"label\":\"3:4\",\"value\":\"3:4\"},{\"label\":\"3:2\",\"value\":\"3:2\"},{\"label\":\"2:3\",\"value\":\"2:3\"}],\"resolution\":[{\"label\":\"1K\",\"value\":\"1K\"},{\"label\":\"2K\",\"value\":\"2K\"},{\"label\":\"4K\",\"value\":\"4K\"}],\"duration\":[]}}}]}]}"
          }
        },
