ference image while converting everything into this consistent doodle-art style. The final image should feel hand-sketched, slightly imperfect, adorable, expressive, and effortlessly stylish, not like polished vector art or 3D cartoon art.\",\"promptLocked\":true,\"bagLabel\":\"ä¸Šå‚³åƒè€ƒåœ–ç‰‡\",\"lockModel\":\"openai/gpt-image-2\",\"modelLocked\":false,\"aspectRatio\":\"1:1\",\"aspectRatioLocked\":true,\"resolution\":\"1K\",\"resolutionLocked\":false,\"output\":\"image\",\"surfaces\":[\"design-sidebar\",\"home-grid\"],\"isEnabled\":true,\"sortOrder\":0}}\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"finish-step\"}\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"finish\",\"finishReason\":\"tool-calls\"}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n"
